@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### First page, small, so pagination is easy to see
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/2/audit-logs?limit=3

### Next page (paste nextCursor from the response above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/2/audit-logs?limit=3&cursor=31

### Limit too big (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/2/audit-logs?limit=500